From f103a4f6aa024dc434b14c963d9500733ea4db02 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ff98li <li.feifei.official@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 20:57:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add native worker provider for container-less hosts

Adds a 'native' worker provider that spawns worker processes directly
instead of Docker containers, a host nvidia-smi fallback for GPU
enumeration, a FLOWMESH_COLLECT_GPU toggle so CPU workers report no GPU,
and defensive provider-spec loading (docker.from_env raises eagerly on
hosts without Docker).

Signed-off-by: ff98li <li.feifei.official@gmail.com>
---
